## ⚙️ Run Locally

```bash
# 1. Clone the repository
git clone [https://github.com/Ziyad-alabduljabbar/Saudi-Traffic-Accidents-Analysis.git](https://github.com/Ziyad-alabduljabbar/Saudi-Traffic-Accidents-Analysis.git)
cd Saudi-Traffic-Accidents-Analysis

# 2. Open the project in RStudio and install required packages in the Console:
install.packages(c("tidyverse", "rmarkdown", "tinytex"))
tinytex::install_tinytex()

# 3. Open the .Rmd file and click "Knit" to generate the PDF/Word/HTML report
